        "uuid": "6586c065_fd082154",
        "filename": "javatests/com/google/gerrit/acceptance/api/flow/ListActionsIT.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 83,
      "author": {
        "id": 1083225
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T11:37:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I can imagine some useful info being later added to the type such as the main condition type for which the action is attached.\n\nCurrently when configuring a handler, we don\u0027t specify if it\u0027s for Gerrit to evaluate or for some other evaluation system.\n\nSo returning the entire type makes sense.\n\nIt\u0027s just the params field as of now is not very useful but that is more of a limitation of the FlowAction type.",
      "parentUuid": "4321e733_a6b1a030",
      "revId": "a2a8d2e1c6c5944812b94251d69ebe8234308b91",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c5996108_c4624a7c",
        "filename": "javatests/com/google/gerrit/acceptance/api/flow/ListActionsIT.java",
        "patchSetId": 11
      },
      "lineNbr": 83,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003935
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T11:50:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the parameter field is not useful, then FlowActionInfo doesn\u0027t look like the right type to return.\n\nFlowActionInfo is a specific action that should be performed on a change, e.g. \"add user 123 as a reviewer\".\n\nI think semantically you want to provide a list of supported action types, e.g.:\nflowActionType \u003d {\n  name \u003d \"addReviewer\",\n  description \u003d \"Adds a user as a reviewer\"\n}\n\nMaybe later we also want to include information about the allowed parameters, for example a description of the parameters or how many parameters are expected etc.\n\nSo too me this look like it should be a new type instead of reusing FlowActionInfo and omitting the parameters field.",
      "parentUuid": "6586c065_fd082154",
      "revId": "a2a8d2e1c6c5944812b94251d69ebe8234308b91",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
