      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T11:51:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I think I can imagine some useful info being later added to the type such\n\u003e as the main condition type for which the action is attached.\n\nThis can make sense too, but it doesn\u0027t belong into FlowActionInfo which is what users provide when creating a flow.",
      "parentUuid": "c5996108_c4624a7c",
      "revId": "a2a8d2e1c6c5944812b94251d69ebe8234308b91",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
