      "writtenOn": "2025-11-03T11:54:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think FlowActionInfo is incorrectly named then\n\nWDYT about renaming this to `FlowActionInput` and then keeping `FlowActionInfo` for the type that describes the action itself.",
      "parentUuid": "332ede56_a904233c",
      "revId": "a2a8d2e1c6c5944812b94251d69ebe8234308b91",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
